=== SURVEY ===
- Hook: useLifetimeStats() from @/api/hooks/useAnalytics — returns LifetimeStats with total_distance_km, total_drives, total_energy_kwh, co2_offset_kg, total_charging_cost, ownership_days, etc.
- Shared: WidgetStatGrid from ./shared — handles stat card grid layout, compact mode, empty state.
- WidgetShell freshness props: updatedAt, isFetching, isStale, isError, onRefresh.
- useSettings provides: convertDistance (mi→user pref), distanceUnit, formatCurrency.
- API total_distance_km is in km; must convert km→mi (× UNITS.KM_TO_MI) then pass to convertDistance.
- Registry: analytics category, after monthly-mileage entry. Trophy icon from lucide-react.
- Existing pattern reference: WeeklySummaryCardWidget.tsx — compact/standard layout branching, UNITS.KM_TO_MI conversion.

=== REASONING ===
- Compact (cols<=1): Single AnimatedNumber showing total miles with "lifetime" label. Min touch target 44px.
- Standard (2×2): WidgetStatGrid with 4 core stats: Total Distance, Total Drives, Total Energy, CO₂ Saved.
- Wide (cols>=3): Add Total Cost, Ownership Days, Avg Daily Distance via wideStats appended to coreStats. cols=4 layout.
- Distance conversion: total_distance_km × KM_TO_MI → convertDistance → display. Same for avg daily.
- All strings via useTranslation('dashboard'). Null-safe with ?? 0 on every field.
- No recharts/leaflet needed — pure stat grid widget.

